Do not build the ZFS file system kernel module, libraries such as
.Xr libbe 3 ,
and user commands such as
.Xr zpool 8
or
.Xr zfs 8 .
Also disable ZFS support in utilities and libraries which implement
ZFS-specific functionality.
.Pp
HalfBSD requires this feature in top-level amd64 runtime builds.
Disabling it is supported only for individual components, bootstrap tools,
and compatibility-library sub-builds.
